flowchart LR
  P([Product Constraint]) -->|Drives| R[Quality Requirement]
  R -->|Defines| SLI[Measurable SLI]
  SLI -->|Sets target| SLO[SLO & Error Budget]
  SLO -->|Latency target| L1[Cache / Edge / Indexing]
  SLO -->|Availability target| L2[Redundancy & Health Checks]
  SLO -->|Durability target| L3[WAL & Multi-AZ Replicas]
  L1 -.->|Trade-off| C1[Staleness & invalidation]
  L2 -.->|Trade-off| C2[Higher infra & ops cost]
  L3 -.->|Trade-off| C3[Write latency overhead]
